    {
        "text": "Talulah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "text": "The preparations are complete.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_011_talula_1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's time to make our move.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_011_talula_1",
        "name2": "char_1502_crowns",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_011_talula_1",
        "name2": "char_1502_crowns",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "--Speak.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_011_talula_1",
        "name2": "char_1502_crowns",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There actually is a strategic purpose for us to attack Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we can take control of Lungmen, Reunion will have a huge advantage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, this comes with a high risk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Why are you preoccupied with this idea?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Crownslayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_011_talula_1",
        "name2": "char_1502_crowns",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
